        "custom_title": "Aero-Comfort",
        "intro_highlight": "Engineered in North America to support the physical demands of high-volume aesthetic clinics, the Aero-Comfort treatment chair bridges the gap between client relaxation and long-term practitioner ergonomics. By eliminating complex electrical failures while providing targeted mechanical positioning, this manual treatment station delivers daily reliability for busy skincare practices.",
